But what are they asking for? FRANCE 24's Tanishk Saha explains.</summary></entry><entry><title>Israel's Netanyahu says co-pilot tried to crash Tel Aviv-bound plane</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:355a2a9bfcea6a70bb76f38298a79124fbf36ac554031ce55c527d75901d5010</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:08:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T10:00:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/press-review/20261001-israel-s-netanyahu-says-co-pilot-tried-to-crash-tel-aviv-bound-plane--0359d75b68e9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/press-review/20261001-israel-s-netanyahu-says-co-pilot-tried-to-crash-tel-aviv-bound-plane" /><summary type="html">PRESS REVIEW – Thursday, October 1: A FlyDubai flight was diverted to Saudi Arabia after the pilot was stabbed by his co-pilot in what the Israeli media are calling a terror attack. The co-pilot was detained by off-duty pilots on board and passengers before making a safe landing in Saudi Arabia. Also in the news, Cornell University's college campus culture is back under scrutiny after a shocking sexual assault claim. Plus, a man learns that Singapore does not take AI slop lightly.</summary><category term="Press Review" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil elections: Can Lula’s anti-poverty record win over voters?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da99a98dbf9f42c1ff58232fba0f31067813378112c4f9327c5f67a2c6360037</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:08:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T09:51:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261001-brazil-elections-can-lula-s-anti-poverty-record-win-over-voters--e3f319067447.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261001-brazil-elections-can-lula-s-anti-poverty-record-win-over-voters" /><summary type="html">In Brazil, incumbent President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva is seeking a fourth and final term in the presidential election on October 4. In 2022, he made 